": "985226397159650", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307409_985226400492983_8207624562039533088_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yjCQemmjHmwQ7kNvwEylQTM&_nc_oc=AdprmB3uJl3WPIKY-YAmCvyYz7FMPdLxUcWepAZXk3oQle98muz7JNZUTO3ssc9iGZw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP50dWyJn6CG_XWYqDVaL1fIoEmbhe7LSqsEuaWvvdO1Q&oe=6AE21445"}, {"file_name": "TextTool.png", "id": "1229645078120613", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296201_1229645081453946_2602537216809768206_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cY73XelIBsUQ7kNvwHXl4sl&_nc_oc=Adqh7uAaKizFU-_Dr1VdgHhwXxUEVUcx9IiHq0vlsjdVTh5b17R5oKLKzz8NvnmWhjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMB7vvs4XQMcqqFI9q4QS0zo1bPCYDOtOBisFtjjC3W2Q&oe=6AE21AE1"}, {"file_name": "emojis.png", "id": "1440095157345894", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831273_1440095160679227_9175729624173159440_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Uknrj2PL3gQ7kNvwE3WbET&_nc_oc=Adp4GIyYJ8KfmKd4oTPVKpCvhNG4y4SmM7Q1eFKBqknAn7Pf1-SbZotMfJIRN2xuA1Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMjW8sOyR6bEo-fvKLV2C7KgZd0-hAV-oZj7hQuafC_SQ&oe=6AE21046"}, {"file_name": "drawings.png", "id": "1250279539986138", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830032_1250279543319471_5762355672284679861_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nrsQ5aNpzw8Q7kNvwEXZyQv&_nc_oc=AdrP16oMP5XZa3NtKvpwUgIkviSj8EupMvxb14ja3HOjppO_r_0gZwTyiovtTtQ5joc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPVmQxp2_cUypTSDVB5ejSxskDDg0Nhv-qX4P2LNbREPA&oe=6AE204B7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "758312620198178", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298205_758312623531511_3363769476488943806_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IoRUxuvLDeYQ7kNvwHgNTvO&_nc_oc=AdqFiPq6hTCuFyrqH51sqlMnQXmuj66ejdtj-cdmvBDVkZKQTusaZApZKHfhjB6aG-4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOV441tBcx_CZW6arjq_X9iyUiU63k7VsZhsVByhfHGTA&oe=6AE20EBD"}, "display_name": "Dear Metaverse", "keywords": ["messaging", "communication", "mail", "mailbox", "creativity"], "long_description": "Dear You,\nWelcome to Dear Metaverse! \n\nHere, you can use your hands to make wild 3D letters and send them to your friends- Heartfelt confessions, chaotic memes, or whatever weird idea pops into your head. You\u2019ll get stuff too, straight to your own virtual mailbox- sometimes sweet, sometimes unhinged, always surprising.\n\nIt's a space to stay close, be creative, and just have fun with the people you care about.\n\nThis early version includes:\n\u2726 A working mailbox that shows when you\u2019ve got mail\n\u2726 Hand-tracked tools for drawing, writing, and decorating\n\u2726 Fully 3D letters you can grab, open, and explore\n\nSincerely, The Dear Metaverse Team", "short_description": "Dear Metaverse is a delightful VR messaging app for exchanging spatial messages with friends. Use hand-tracked tools to draw, write, and decorate your message, then deliver your message straight to a friend\u2019s virtual mailbox. Will you send heartfelt messages? Or will you create memes and utter chaos?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://studiosyro.com/dm-privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Studio Syro", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://studiosyro.com/dear-metaverse", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "r